		{"id":"9ddc1fdec03b1c10","type":"text","text":"Table for elite elemnt mixing with  basic elements\n\n| elite element --> | time     | Fate    | abyss      | duplication |\n| ----------------- | -------- | ------- | ---------- | ----------- |\n| basic element V   | x        | x       | x          | x           |\n| fire              | spark    | thermal | curseflame | ember       |\n| earth             | pressure | destiny | space      | shift       |\n| air               | blow     | musica  | astral     | echo        |\n| water             | corode   | tide    | waste      | flood       |\n| nature            | life     | bloom   | eldrith    | overgrowth  |\n| light             | atom     | order   | vanguard   | illusion    |\n| dark              | drain    | omen    | void       | x           |\n| electricity       | perpetum | chain   | fuse       | x           |\n","x":-2320,"y":-2000,"width":700,"height":418},
